# Stray root index.html. This is an Astro project: the homepage is generated
# from src/pages/index.astro into dist/. A file here is never served, so a copy
# at the root is a trap — it looks like the live homepage and silently isn't.
# Root-anchored so it can't shadow dist/index.html or a future public/index.html.
/index.html
